{"server":"tw","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_st01","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_st01","title":"浪潮守望者","storyCode":"BP-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"108a45c1cb4090071fec00a66c8b81aac4db70e33d63c5306ec4c24b3d2592ea","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好久不見，斯卡蒂。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你好啊，斯卡蒂。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"按照約定，來接你的應該是那個臉皮很厚話又多的黎博利，但你好像並不驚訝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你和極境都是羅德島的幹員。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"畢竟這裡更靠近你的故鄉。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你比凱爾希估計的晚到了快一個小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"看來就算有聖徒開具的公函，審判庭該有的審查程序還是一樣沒落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"才不到三個月，除了能派上用場的工人外，這裡的居民全都遷去了內陸城鎮，取而代之的是幾個大陣的懲戒軍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們在緊鑼密鼓地籌備著什麼。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他們看起來非常緊張。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"自從一週前，伊比利亞收到了來自阿戈爾的聯絡，這座被遺忘的小鎮就不再安靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"遍地的海洋殘渣刺激著這些年輕戰士的神經，阿戈爾的聲音只會加重他們的焦慮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿戈爾的行動確實值得關注甚至戒備。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"遠海中的國家突然發聲，沒人能充耳不聞。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"沿著雕塑左邊的這條街道過去，走得快一點，十分鐘就能看到大海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們待會直接前往伊比利亞之眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你聽見海浪了嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂微微側過了頭，迎向海風吹來的方向，她的長髮在風中舞動，與眼中的陰翳同色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"浪的層次變得很複雜，我還聽見了——星空流動的聲音，永不停歇的自然的歌，還有，不被理解的語言……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Ishar-mla。\n我在。\n我們遭受的苦永在。\n我們渴望的生永在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"斯卡蒂，你還好嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"和家鄉恢復聯繫，反而讓你心神不寧？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"近鄉情怯吧……算了，這種感受很難總結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"也可能只是沒睡好覺，上次回了一趟海裡，好像鯊魚把她的夢都轉移給我了一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，凱爾希醫生為什麼這麼著急地叫你過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得你接觸過海洋，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不一定，但我記不清了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"但似乎，並不陌生。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這個回答很模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我忘了你的情況。這個回答其實很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，凱爾希醫生把你叫過來，總有她的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，天快要黑下來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別靠過來，等我把水甩乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，醫生。很少有人能鎖定深海獵人的行蹤。劍魚提前告訴你我們要從這裡上岸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境在這一片海域布置了訊息採集裝置，目前已經完成校準，與伊比利亞之眼的中控系統直接連通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼短的時間，架設一套針對水下環境的定位系統，那個黎博利還蠻有辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該理解為，羅德島與審判庭加深了合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一週前，水下的那座城市藉由特殊頻段告知伊比利亞，阿戈爾將開闢一條連通阿戈爾本境與陸地的“航道”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而面對這項龐大的計劃，除了大燈塔的定位系統，伊比利亞幾乎沒有其他獲取情報的途徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顯然，作為總戰爭設計師的您，對此也毫不知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚，告訴凱爾希我們的發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我和隊長第三次潛回斯圖提斐拉沉沒的地方，距離上一次，僅僅相隔了十天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次的時候，還能看見爆炸後殘存的船體插在海床上，藉著從海面透下的微光，艙體內部的金色像是暈開的顏料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這一次，巨大的金屬船體結構已經完全消失，取而代之的是一片生機盎然的珊瑚叢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我習慣了做夢，但依然覺得不真實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那塊悼亡文明與歷史的碑，只樹立了極短的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“愚人號”已經徹底變成了海洋的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確說，化作了海嗣巢穴的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣同化環境的速度加快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但還有更值得關注的事情。我們的確發現了戰爭的痕跡，而且就發生在不久前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全淨空，連海雪也不見一絲的海域；扭曲破碎，明顯被微型奇點撕扯過的海床……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能做到這些的，恐怕只有阿戈爾正規軍團的艦隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一個常在陸地上行走的人，凱爾希，你對阿戈爾的關注與了解超乎尋常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然遠隔無垠的海水，但阿戈爾依然屬於泰拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和歌蕾蒂婭已經決定，前往那座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這無疑是一個冒險的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有一點冒險啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相當冒險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，深海獵人已經觀察了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那次行動之前，我作為深海獵人總戰爭設計師參加了科學院與技術院的軍事會議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在兩院當時制定的戰爭預案裡，並不存在一座靠近陸地的軍事要塞，也不存在涉及“航道”的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無疑問，阿戈爾經歷了重大變故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斬殺伊莎瑪拉之後，我們和本境的聯繫徹底斷絕。根據已知的情報很難拼湊出真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這並不能構成你們重返阿戈爾的充足理由。最先勸阻你們的人甚至並不是我，而是你們舊日的同僚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說……烏爾比安？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安也一定明白，陸地上不會有答案。我們必須回到海洋之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果刻意與阿戈爾保持距離是他的策略，那我們就更有必要以正式的姿態回歸阿戈爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……自我從睡夢中清醒以來，海浪時刻在訴說著，迷途的人該回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海獵人，必須返回故鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭，我會與你們同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對你而言，這的確是個不可多得的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我此行並不僅僅代表我自己，甚至不僅僅代表羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞？他們往你已經不堪重負的肩膀上多加了一副擔子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這同樣是我自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島與伊比利亞審判庭的合作剛剛起步，正如我們之間的合作也依然只是開始。"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希凝視著歌蕾蒂婭，海風沒有吹皺對方那張毫無表情的臉。\n短暫的沉默後，歌蕾蒂婭點了點頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮，距離我們收到阿戈爾的聯絡已經有幾天了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八天了，聖徒閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這八天裡，除了必要的布置、會議和休息時間，您一直站在這裡觀察著海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾一方並未給出明確的接洽時間，我理解您擔心錯過他們的動向，但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮，看看眼前的海。"},{"type":"narration","text":"難以辨明顏色的深沉海洋湧動著。或許是海面太過遼闊，天空便顯得低沉。\n海水撞擊礁石，激起幾公尺高的浪濤，在這狹小的天地間激盪出轟然聲響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對伊比利亞來說，沒有翻湧著恐魚血肉的海洋，哪怕再喧囂，也是仁慈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一位故友，曾是港都最富才情的詩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宏偉的港都沉入靜謐之後，他掙扎著一路向北逃亡，踏著遍地餓殍來到了內陸深處，那座日後將會成為首都的小城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到他在破落的城門前跪下，不住地哀哭。那座城市就從哭聲中得到了新的名字，佩爾多尼朵拉，“寬恕已去”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，當時的人們需要的不是哀悼，而是撫慰。許多人更習慣將那個名字簡稱為佩爾多尼——“寬恕”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，黃金時代的遺產，最後的伊比利亞之眼重新亮起，艾麗妮，這意味著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望和決心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“希望和決心”，當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人，你回答我時的眼神要比達里奧年輕時更加堅毅，這很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這種鼓舞人心的發言往往並不是最準確的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半個世紀後，我們一再後撤的防線終於重新向前推進至此。很快，這裡將會成為審判庭新的中樞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可與此同時，我們也將一切袒露在了海洋——海嗣，還有阿戈爾——面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞已捉襟見肘。這個國家無法再掩藏它長久以來的疲弱和困病，這是不爭的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而另一個事實是，我們已不可能再次退卻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師——哎呀，艾麗妮閣下，好久不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這套衣服還滿適合你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝、謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對了，緊急情況——燈塔剛剛偵測到了一批來歷不明的訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"訊號來源似乎不是海底，而是天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，我想它已經肉眼可見了……"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡門和艾麗妮緊緊盯著遠處的天空。年輕的書記順著兩人的視線看過去。\n他愣在原地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i01_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們看見了飛翔的鱗群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"仿生無人機。早年島民帶上岸的器物裡，曾有過類似的造物。"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人機矩陣眨眼間便已越過海面，與高聳的大燈塔遙相對應。其中一隻脫離編隊，緩緩懸停在三人的面前。\n機翼如鰭翕動，光的微粒在虛空中舞蹈，親切而富有磁性的女聲旋即響起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i01_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（伊比利亞語）伊比利亞的諸位，請不必緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是來自阿戈爾的致意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是本國社會行政監察所的技術執政官之一，克萊門莎。"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡門端舉提燈，平靜地直視著身前的無人機。\n兩種截然不同的光亮，彷彿兩個截然不同的文明的對話——或者對峙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞審判庭，聖徒卡門·伊·伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，這應當是我們兩國之間的首次正式交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您的伊比利亞語很標準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"離開本境前，我為自己錄入過伊比利亞的語言模組。如果我的表達有不得當的地方，還請您理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此外，也請原諒我暫時只能以這種形式與您溝通，伊比利亞……閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們對這種形式的交流沒有異議，但我對它發生得如此之遲感到遺憾，執政官閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被你們稱為“航道”的計劃據稱已經進行到後半，而近在咫尺的伊比利亞仍對種種細節一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們將迎接伊比利亞的使節前往我們的城市，阿戈爾尊重伊比利亞在被海嗣危機波及時所做出的努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“波及”——伊比利亞所面對的，只是危機的餘波？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必糾結外交辭令，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們都認同語言的力量。而您的姓名，卡門·伊·伊比利亞，本身便已是一種象徵，勇氣與魄力的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以阿戈爾才會來此。我們希望達成與伊比利亞、與陸上諸國的合作，開闢一條直抵陸地的航道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們將淨空從阿戈爾本境到陸地之間的大片海域，以便阿戈爾的主力抵達海岸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我想我不必提醒您，將大量軍隊派遣至其他國家的邊境，這種行為在陸上意味著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"意味著為了對抗即將到來的巨大威脅，我們將竭盡所能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如有必要，我願意前往陸地與您會晤，向您詳細解釋一切。但來到深海，會方便諸位更好地理解我們當下的處境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第八與第十軍團的艦隊正在有序清剿沿途海嗣。他們隨後將迎接諸位前往我們的城市，彌利亞留姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無人機編隊將持續向諸位同步戰鬥進展與環境變化，直到諸位安全抵達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海洋或許正在醞釀一場前所未有的災難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而審判官閣下，我憂心大地即使再浩瀚，也不過是另一座孤島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人機矩陣收斂了輝光，這場突如其來的通訊已經結束。\n海風依舊在吹，老人緩緩放下了手中的提燈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“直抵陸地的航道”——她的表達很得體，但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾無疑是傲慢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個手持利器的傲慢大人，不屑於對赤手空拳的孩子耍弄心機與手腕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮，將剛剛的通訊內容同步給我們的合作夥伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希已經同意作為伊比利亞的使節出訪阿戈爾，一直對航道計劃心存疑慮的深海獵人此時應該也已經做出了決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會盡快與格蘭法洛的其他審判官將事務交接清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，剛才與阿戈爾通訊的全部內容，我都做了紀錄，請您過目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您是否批准我前往……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"書記，一週前你就已經提交了申請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，既然現在阿戈爾的艦隊馬上就要來了，我想，是不是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果已經做了決定，猶豫反而會讓你的表態沒有說服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很小的時候，蒂亞戈叔叔就總是憂心忡忡的。他跟我說：“喬迪，你應該離開格蘭法洛，離開伊比利亞。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他沒辦法告訴我，我該去哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾，那是我的家鄉，我的家鄉在大海裡，而大海無法靠近。我從沒聽過阿戈爾的聲音，也從沒看過阿戈爾的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，它很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭同意你的申請，喬迪·方塔納羅薩。你將作為伊比利亞的使節，與艾麗妮和凱爾希一同前往阿戈爾的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。這並不是一次獎勵，你在審判庭的工作做得算不上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"選擇艾麗妮，是因為她已經做好了準備，甚至為此拋棄了自己堅持許久的信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而選擇你，恰恰是因為你仍然困惑和悵然，軟弱終究會腐蝕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入審判庭是一次考驗，回到自己的家鄉，同樣也是一次考驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我明白的，老師。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經是海溝的最深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們掏空了海溝兩側的峭壁，向內築巢。所以我們繞了好幾圈，都沒有發現這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（警惕的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我也聞到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種氣味……海嗣在摧毀了原有的海洋生態之後，又建立了一套完全只為它們自己服務的生態系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此完善的海嗣生態系統，原本只存在於海洋的深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，羅辛南特。接下來我一個人進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不悅地晃動脖頸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整塊大陸架都在變化，我需要知道，究竟是誰在使海浪鼓噪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴騎士，別停止狩獵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是暫時分別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏爾比安游進了巢穴。\n他沒有選擇潛行，因為發光的植物海嗣點亮了巢穴的每一個角落，他無處可藏。\n在盤旋而上的厚實葉片之間，造型奇特的微小生物在酣眠或游弋。\n海床原本的岩石已不可見。溟痕緩緩搖動著細小的觸肢，捕捉著有機物的碎屑，它們織成層層疊疊的菌毯，淹沒了烏爾比安游動的聲響。\n他清晰地感受到自己身體的變化。意識在舒展，軀殼在放鬆，體內的每一個細胞都在試圖回應著什麼。\n他分明是闖入這裡的異類，但整個巢穴都在向自己盛開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ul……Ul-pian……咕……Ul-pianus，同胞。"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏爾比安幾乎能看穿海嗣接近透明的軀體，他在等待對方吐出捕食或者被他捕食之類的蠢話，但是並沒有。\n海嗣，在思考他的思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"終於。你走過長路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡。營養足夠。褪去累贅的血肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回歸。滋長。遷徙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我為你而生，Ul-pianus，只為你而生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我解開你。疑惑。我引導你。回歸族群懷抱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們因何遷徙？你們要去向何方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，你仍動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞，你需要知曉大群。你想要知曉大群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生代即將甦醒。生代需要回歸。新的循環。建構海洋。離開海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生代甦醒？離開海洋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大群。看見。新的長路。我們盡快——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……那麼，那座城市在進行的事情，與你們有什麼關聯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
